body:
@domenic I can definitely write it up, but I've got to admit that git has been throttling me and I cannot figure out how to make things nice for this repo. I also have a couple questions:
- Yea/nay on SMIL? Blink dropping support for it is highly political, so I don't know if I should suggest one way or the other.
- Should `<title>` and `<desc>`'s content model be changed? They should definitely be able to hold HTML, but right now `<svg><title><svg><title><svg><title>...</title></svg></title></svg></title></svg>` and `<desc><title>I'm an HTML title!</title><base href="//example.com/"></desc>` are both valid.
